# 🎒 AETHERIA — ITEM + INVENTORY SYSTEM

> **Every item has a purpose.**
>
> **Every reward has a record.**
>
> **Every acquisition changes the Game State.**
>
> **And the Fairy reports what the Master receives.**

The **Item + Inventory System** manages every item, resource, currency, reward, and collectible obtained by the Master throughout Aetheria.

The system is responsible for:

```text
Item Creation
Item Identity
Item ID
Item Name
Item Description
Item Effect
Item Skill
Item Rarity
Item Type
Item Source
Item Acquisition
Item Usage
Item Quantity
Inventory
Currency
Gold
Gems
Summon Tickets
Special Tickets
Floor Rewards
Enemy Loot
Quest Rewards
Starter Package
Database Synchronization
Game State Synchronization
AI Fairy Reporting
```

---

