                              │
                              ▼
                      GAME STATE SYSTEM
                              │
             ┌────────────────┼────────────────┐
             │                │                │
             ▼                ▼                ▼
        QUEST SYSTEM      FLOOR SYSTEM      EVENT SYSTEM
             │                │                │
             ▼                ▼                ▼
        QUEST REWARD      FLOOR REWARD      EVENT REWARD
             │                │                │
             └────────────────┼────────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
                         RNG SYSTEM
                              │
                              ▼
                         LOOT SYSTEM
                              │
                              ▼
