# 2. CORE PRINCIPLE

Every reward received by the Master must pass through the Item + Inventory System.

Sources include:

```text
Enemy Loot
Floor Rewards
Quest Rewards
Event Rewards
Recruitment Rewards
Starter Package
NPC Rewards
Exploration Rewards
Achievement Rewards
System Rewards
Special Events
```

The system must never allow rewards to bypass inventory/account synchronization.

---

# 3. ITEM CREATION WITH AI

Item names, descriptions, effects, skills, and flavor text can be generated with AI.

However:

> **AI generates the content definition.**

The actual game effect must be validated by the Item System.

```text
AI
 ↓
Generate Item Concept
 ↓
Item Validation
 ↓
Item System
 ↓
Item ID
 ↓
Database
```

AI may generate:

```text
Item Name
Description
Lore
Skill Name
Skill Description
Visual Concept
Flavor Text
Possible Effect Concept
```

The system determines:

```text
Actual Effect Value
Duration
Cooldown
Stack Limit
Target
Restrictions
Rarity
Drop Rate
Economic Value
```

