# 63. TRANSACTION ATOMICITY

If the reward contains:

```text
Gold
Gem
Item
Ticket
```

all should be processed as one reward transaction.

Example:

```text
Reward Transaction:

Gold +5,000
Gem +100
Ticket +2
Potion +3
```

If synchronization fails, the system should prevent partial reward loss or duplication.

---

# 64. DUPLICATE REWARD PROTECTION

Every transaction receives a unique:

```text
TRANSACTION_ID
```

Example:

```text
TRANSACTION-001992
```

If the same transaction is processed twice:

```text
Transaction already exists
        ↓
Reject duplicate
```

This prevents double rewards.

